Let House of the Dead 4 Special start again after game over

After game over the game sends ride command 0x19 and waits for 0x06
(back to waiting for the attendant). The case fell through into 0x05
and replied 0x05 instead, so the game sat in attract and never started
again.

--- a/src/loader/hardware/lindbergh/rideBoard.c
+++ b/src/loader/hardware/lindbergh/rideBoard.c
@@ -247,6 +247,7 @@
         break;
     case 0x19: // Work out what ADF means?
         state->CommandReply = 0x06;
+        break;
     case 0x05: // Coin play, not coined up
         state->CommandReply = 0x05;
         break;
